# ~/.claude is symlinked straight into this directory, and Claude Code
# writes a lot of runtime state there (transcripts, history, caches) and
# keeps credentials in it. Track only the declarative config.
*
!.gitignore
!settings.json
!CLAUDE.md
!agents/
!agents/**
!commands/
!commands/**
!skills/
!skills/**
!hooks/
!hooks/**
!output-styles/
!output-styles/**
